      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Three Bedroom Homes \r\n\r\nComing soon to Oldtown Woods, Celbridge, these elegant three bedroom homes by O’Flynn Group have been thoughtfully designed to meet the needs of contemporary family living. Located off Shackleton Road in this highly regarded and established development, Oldtown Woods offers the perfect blend of a mature, leafy setting and everyday convenience, with Celbridge village, a choice of schools, leisure amenities and excellent commuter connections all close at hand.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThese beautifully crafted homes will feature spacious accommodation, high-quality finishes, beautifully appointed kitchens and bathrooms, private gardens and an impressive A2 energy rating.\r\n\r\nSelling agents Lisney Sotheby’s International Realty and Coonan Property invite interested purchasers to register their interest now to receive further details on this exciting forthcoming release."
      },
